// **WHAT DOG PARK SERVES BESIDES ITS CODE** (webbox's Phase B contract, as
// angry-gopher's zig-server/assets.zon): `.embedded`, front-end files compiled
// in by name (none: the page is read from disk), and `.site`, directories its
// routes read at request time from where it runs, relative to this file
// (solo/: the page and its script), each laid whole onto a machine's site disk.
.{
    .embedded = .{},
    .site = .{"solo"},
}
